  "initialKey": 0,
  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 260,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00000000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 2,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "南瓜精的新的事实被发现后，\n在南瓜精圈儿引起了大轰动……<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 272,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "535774DC7CBE768465B076844E8B5B9E88AB53D173B0540EFF0C000A5728535774DC7CBE5708513F5F158D774E8659278F7052A82026202600100002011401750000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    },
    {
      "displayText": "新的事实？",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 340,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "65B076844E8B5B9EFF1F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "大轰动？",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 352,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "59278F7052A8FF1F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "根据南瓜精的大小，以往是按照\n小尺寸、普通尺寸、<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n大尺寸、特大尺寸<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n这样来分类的……<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 364,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6839636E535774DC7CBE768459275C0FFF0C4EE55F80662F63097167000A5C0F5C3A5BF83001666E901A5C3A5BF8300100100001BE00000A59275C3A5BF83001727959275C3A5BF800100001BE00000A8FD96837676552067C7B76842026202600100002011401750000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 53
    },
    {
      "displayText": "可竟然！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 472,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "53EF7ADF7136FF0100100002011401750000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 9
    },
    {
      "displayText": "人们发现，\n它们其实不是尺寸不同，<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n而是种类各异的宝可梦！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 492,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4EBA4EEC53D173B0FF0C000A5B834EEC51765B9E4E0D662F5C3A5BF84E0D540CFF0C00100001BE00000A800C662F79CD7C7B54045F0276845B9D53EF68A6FF0100100002011401750000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 37
    },
    {
      "displayText": "于是新的名字诞生了，\n那就是小颗种、中颗种、大颗种和巨颗种。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 568,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E8E662F65B07684540D5B578BDE751F4E86FF0C000A90A35C31662F5C0F989779CD30014E2D989779CD30015927989779CD548C5DE8989779CD300200100002011401750000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 35
    },
    {
      "displayText": "与其说是种类有别，\n不如说它们听起来都像是品种名……<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 640,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E0E51768BF4662F79CD7C7B6709522BFF0C000A4E0D59828BF45B834EEC542C8D77676590FD50CF662F54C179CD540D2026202600100002011401750000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我很在意种类是否真的不同，\n于是收集了每种尺寸的南瓜精。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 704,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62115F885728610F79CD7C7B662F5426771F76844E0D540CFF0C000A4E8E662F653696C64E866BCF79CD5C3A5BF87684535774DC7CBE300200100002011401750000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    },
    {
      "displayText": "但是我还没有找到\n尺寸最大的巨颗种……！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 772,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F46662F62118FD86CA16709627E5230000A5C3A5BF86700592776845DE8989779CD20262026FF0100100002011401750000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "南瓜精的巨颗种\n会在夜里现身于15号野生特区。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 824,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "535774DC7CBE76845DE8989779CD000A4F1A5728591C91CC73B08EAB4E8E0031003553F791CE751F7279533A300200100002011401750000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "拜托了！\n请你把南瓜精的巨颗种让给我吧！！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 880,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62DC62584E86FF01000A8BF74F60628A535774DC7CBE76845DE8989779CD8BA97ED962115427FF01FF0100100002011401750000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "南瓜精的巨颗种\n比这些孩子还要大！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 932,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "535774DC7CBE76845DE8989779CD000A6BD48FD94E9B5B695B508FD889815927FF0100100002011401750000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "不过，我拜托你的事还要附加一个条件。\n那就是请排除掉头目……<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n因为那会无法知道真正的大小。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 976,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E0D8FC7FF0C621162DC62584F6076844E8B8FD88981964452A04E004E2A67614EF63002000A90A35C31662F8BF7639296646389593476EE2026202600100001BE00000A56E04E3A90A34F1A65E06CD577E59053771F6B63768459275C0F300200100002011401750000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 53
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+000F>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 1084,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "你愿意把\n南瓜精的巨颗种让给我吗？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 1096,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F60613F610F628A000A535774DC7CBE76845DE8989779CD8BA97ED962115417FF1F00100002011401750000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "让出",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 1140,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8BA951FA0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 3
    },
    {
      "displayText": "不让",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 1148,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E0D8BA90000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 3
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我的期待已经过度膨胀成巨颗种了！\n请你快点让给我！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 1156,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62117684671F5F855DF27ECF8FC75EA681A880C062105DE8989779CD4E86FF01000A8BF74F605FEB70B98BA97ED96211FF0100100002011401750000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我希望你让给我的是\n南瓜精的巨颗种。<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n夜晚的15号野生特区\n会出现南瓜精的巨颗种哦。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 1216,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62115E0C671B4F608BA97ED962117684662F000A535774DC7CBE76845DE8989779CD300200100001BE01000A591C665A76840031003553F791CE751F7279533A000A4F1A51FA73B0535774DC7CBE76845DE8989779CD54E6300200100002011401750000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 50
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 1316,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00150000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "这只是头目巨颗种！<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n不行啦！虽然我是挺高兴，\n但如果是这种尺寸的南瓜精，<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n我会担心它要带多少灵魂去那个世界。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 1328,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8FD953EA662F593476EE5DE8989779CDFF0100100001BE01000A4E0D884C5566FF01867D71366211662F633A9AD85174FF0C000A4F465982679C662F8FD979CD5C3A5BF87684535774DC7CBEFF0C00100001BE00000A62114F1A62C55FC35B8389815E26591A5C1170759B4253BB90A34E2A4E16754C300200100002011401750000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 65
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我的担心已经过度膨胀成巨颗种了！\n请容我拒绝头目。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 1460,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6211768462C55FC35DF27ECF8FC75EA681A880C062105DE8989779CD4E86FF01000A8BF75BB9621162D27EDD593476EE300200100002011401750000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "是南瓜精的巨颗种……！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 1520,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "662F535774DC7CBE76845DE8989779CD20262026FF0100100002011401750000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 16
    },
    {
      "displayText": "如此大的身体把巨大尺寸的灵魂\n带去那个世界，简直是悬疑故事！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 1552,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "59826B64592776848EAB4F53628A5DE859275C3A5BF8768470759B42000A5E2653BB90A34E2A4E16754CFF0C7B8076F4662F60AC759165454E8BFF0100100002011401750000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 35
    },
    {
      "displayText": "虽然很像，但尺寸不同的话，\n即使说成是其他种类的宝可梦也能接受！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 1624,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "867D71365F8850CFFF0C4F465C3A5BF84E0D540C76848BDDFF0C000A53734F7F8BF46210662F51764ED679CD7C7B76845B9D53EF68A64E5F80FD63A553D7FF0100100002011401750000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 37
    },
    {
      "displayText": "抱歉。<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n老实说虽然我不太明白，\n但这尺寸震撼了我，让我不得不接受。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 1700,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62B16B49300200100001BE01000A80015B9E8BF4867D713662114E0D592A660E767DFF0C000A4F468FD95C3A5BF8970764BC4E866211FF0C8BA962114E0D5F974E0D63A553D7300200100002011401750000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 41
    },
    {
      "displayText": "为了能配得上这样的尺寸，\n我也要把自己的灵魂培育得更丰盈。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 1784,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E3A4E8680FD914D5F974E0A8FD9683776845C3A5BF8FF0C000A62114E5F8981628A81EA5DF1768470759B4257F980B25F9766F44E3076C8300200100002011401750000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 34
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我发自内心地感谢你\n愿意把巨颗种的南瓜精让给我。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 29,
      "offsetInSection": 1852,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "621153D181EA51855FC35730611F8C224F60000A613F610F628A5DE8989779CD7684535774DC7CBE8BA97ED96211300200100002011401750000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+001E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 30,
      "offsetInSection": 1912,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF001E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "只要有4种南瓜精，\n不管是哪种尺寸的灵魂都能带去那个世界。<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n如果你有需要，就尽管开口哦！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 31,
      "offsetInSection": 1924,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "53EA89816709003479CD535774DC7CBEFF0C000A4E0D7BA1662F54EA79CD5C3A5BF8768470759B4290FD80FD5E2653BB90A34E2A4E16754C300200100001BE00000A5982679C4F60670997008981FF0C5C315C3D7BA15F0053E354E6FF0100100002011401750000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 52
    }
